{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28040","headline":"寄婺州温郎中 · 厉玄","name":"寄婺州温郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"积雪没兰溪，邻州望不迷。\n波中分鴈宿，树杪接猨啼。\n婺女家空在，星郎手未携。\n故山新寺额，掩泣荷重题。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"厉玄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28040.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28040","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}